  "widgetHelp": "Help",
  "widgetHelpTitle": "Widget not added?",
  "widgetHelpBody": "Some phones, such as Xiaomi and Poco, only add widgets after you allow it:\n\n1. Long-press the Little Moon icon and tap App info.\n2. Open Other permissions.\n3. Set Home screen shortcuts to Allow.\n4. Come back and tap the add button again.\n\nAlternatively, long-press an empty spot on your home screen, tap Widgets and find Little Moon.",
