  "careGeneral": "Every day is a new chance to be kinder to yourself.|Listen to your body; it speaks to you every day.|You don't have to be strong every day; being honest with yourself is enough.|Rest is part of your growth journey, too.|You are worthy in every phase of your cycle.|Treat yourself today the way you would treat your best friend.|You don't have to figure everything out today.|Your body deserves care, not criticism.|Give yourself permission to slow down.|You don't have to shine every day; your presence is enough.|One deep breath, one peaceful moment, one fresh start.|Your feelings aren't your enemy; listen to them with kindness.|You are more than what you accomplish today.|Every small step you take for yourself matters.|Work with your body instead of fighting it.|You don't have to be the perfect version of yourself today.|You are allowed to feel hopeful and tired at the same time.|Every cycle is a chance to understand yourself a little better.|Self-kindness is a powerful habit.|Be proud of your progress, even when it's slow.|If you need rest today, listen to yourself.|A calm, nourishing meal is also an act of self-love.|Drink some water and give yourself a few moments.|A little gentle stretching can be an invitation to relax.|Enough sleep is a gift you give your future self.|You don't need a big reason to give yourself a moment of calm.|A warm shower can be a moment just for you.|If your body moves more slowly today, be gentle with it.|Setting boundaries is a form of self-care, too.|Give yourself permission to ask for help.|Do one small thing today that brings you peace.|Your body has real needs; honor them.|Self-care doesn't have to be complicated or expensive.|Ask yourself today: What do I really need?|A few screen-free minutes are a gift to your mind.|Make a promise to judge yourself a little less today.|When you're tired, you don't need to justify resting.|Focus on being real rather than perfect.|You deserve love and respect today, too.|Appreciate y